  Every user-facing string of the app (S24-1). English is the default;
  res/values-es/strings.xml carries the Spanish variant. Rules: sentence
  case, no jargon (never "lease", "snapshot" or "protocol 22" in user
  copy), plurals via <plurals> where a count appears. Never localised:
  agent names, file paths, session ids, fingerprints, protocol numbers.
-->
